description:
Technicians work on equipment. Create an Intervention table: equipment, intervention date, status (Planifiée, Réalisée, Annulée; Planifiée by default), duration in hours, technician (user) and report.

Rules:
- when an intervention becomes Réalisée (done), the equipment's last intervention date is updated with the intervention date (new column on equipment), without ever moving backwards;
- the report is required as soon as the intervention is Réalisée;
- a Réalisée intervention must have a positive duration, otherwise saving is refused with a clear message.
